==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|lexicologies|-}}

# {{uncountable}} {{linguistics}} The part of [[linguistics]] that studies [[word]]s, their nature and meaning, words' elements, relations between words including [[semantic]] relations, words groups and the whole [[lexicon]].
#* '''1949''' ''Journal of Theological Studies''
#*: The fifth is devoted to doctrine; the sixth and seventh to remarks on syntax and '''lexicology''' respectively.
# {{countable}} A specific theory concerning the lexicon.

